//@version=6
indicator("Owners Matrix Pro Dots", shorttitle="OM Dots", overlay=false, max_labels_count=300)

//=============================================================================
// OWNERS MATRIX PRO DOTS
// VMC Cipher B style WaveTrend + Divergence logic
// Includes Owners Matrix table: Fib/Net, ADX Control, RelVol, Wyckoff, Elliott, Rating
// Visual markers remain DOTS on the indicator.
// Dynamic Discord webhook alert router checks 4H, Daily, Weekly, Monthly from only two list alerts.
// For TradingView alerts, use: OM Dots -> Any alert() function call.
//=============================================================================

